==History==
2016
*The Tombstone [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 9/2/2016, the [[Version History#Chest Rewards & Card Balance (9/2/2016)|Chest Rewards &amp; Card Balance Update]], decreased the Tombstone's [[Skeletons]] spawned upon death to 4 (from 6). Its description was also changed, previously saying "''Troop building that periodically deploys Skeletons to fight the enemy. When destroyed, spawns 6 Skeletons. Creepy!''"
*On 19/2/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/2/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Tombstone's lifetime to 40 seconds (from 60 seconds). In addition, the Skeletons' hitpoints and damage were increased by 11%.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March%202016%20Update%20(29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], decreased the Skeletons' sight range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles).
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Rare}} card Level cap to 11 (from 10). The update also fixed the “range bug”, which decreased the Skeletons' range to 0.5 tiles (from 0.75 tiles), but their effective range was unchanged.
*On 18/5/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (18/5/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Tombstone's hitpoints by 10%. In addition, the Skeletons' hitpoints and damage were increased by 5%.
*On 4/7/2016, the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]], increased the Tombstone's hitpoints by 9%.
*On 24/8/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/8/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Tombstone's spawn time interval to 2.55 seconds (from 2.95 seconds).
*On 30/11/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (30/11/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Tombstone's spawn time interval to 2.95 seconds (from 2.55 seconds).
2018
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11).
*On 24/10/2018, a maintenance break, slightly changed the Tombstone's card description. It used to read "''Building that periodically spawns Skeletons to fight the enemy... and when destroyed, spawns more Skeletons! Creepy''".
*On 5/11/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/11/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Tombstone's spawn time interval to 3.1 seconds (from 2.95 seconds) and decreased the Skeletons spawned upon death to 3 (from 4).
*On 5/12/2018, the [[Version History#December%202018%20Update%20(5/12/2018)|December 2018 Update]], changed the Tombstone's card description. It used to read "''Troop building that periodically deploys Skeletons to fight the enemy. When destroyed, spawns 4 Skeletons. Creepy!''"
2020
*On 3/11/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/11/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the Tombstone's hitpoints by 4%.
2021
*On 6/9/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(6/9/2021)|2021 Quarter 3 Update]], increased the Tombstone's Skeletons spawned upon death to 4 (from 3). Its description also changed slightly to account for the death spawn change.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
*On 7/12/2021, the [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/12/2021)|2021 Quarter 4 Update]], decreased the Tombstone's lifetime to 30 seconds (from 40 seconds), increase its spawn time interval to 3.3 seconds (from 3.1 seconds). It also made it so 2 Skeletons will spawn per wave (from 1).
2022
*On 4/4/2022, the [[Version History#April%202022%20Update%20(4/4/2022)|April 2022 Update]], increased its spawn time interval to 3.5 seconds (from 3.3 seconds).
*On 3/6/2022, a maintenance break, added a card render to the Tombstone's card info screen.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Tombstone's hitpoints by 0.18%.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] made it so that the [[Witch/Evolution|Evolved Witch]] would no longer be healed by defeated Skeletons.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]] increased the Skeleton's attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1.0 seconds).

